---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Podcast" sideBarActiveItemID="podcast">
  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">AI Builders: LatinX Edition</div>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-8 text-lg">
    A podcast exploring artificial intelligence through practical conversations with innovators, researchers,
    and builders shaping the future of technology, with a focus on amplifying LatinX voices in AI.
  </div>

  <div class="card bg-base-200 shadow-md mb-8">
    <div class="card-body">
      <p class="text-base">
        Each episode breaks down complex AI concepts in plain language while spotlighting the humans behind
        the work. Guests include ML engineers, AI researchers, community leaders, and founders building at
        the frontier of generative AI, RAG systems, and autonomous agents.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-8">
    <div class="text-2xl w-full font-bold mb-4">Listen On</div>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
      <a
        href="https://open.spotify.com/show/4quI3hyXMd6UjBGy13weMK"
        target="_blank"
        class="btn btn-outline"
      >
        Spotify
      </a>
      <a
        href="https://podcasts.apple.com/podcast/id1837592967"
        target="_blank"
        class="btn btn-outline"
      >
        Apple Podcasts
      </a>
      <a
        href="https://music.amazon.com/podcasts"
        target="_blank"
        class="btn btn-outline"
      >
        Amazon Music
      </a>
      <a
        href="https://rss.com"
        target="_blank"
        class="btn btn-outline"
      >
        RSS
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-2xl w-full font-bold">About the Host</div>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-8 text-base">
    <p>
      Victor Ramirez is Director of Developer & Platform Experience at Moody's Analytics, where he leads AI
      infrastructure and engineering platforms at scale. He teaches AI workshops at Techqueria and has spoken
      at Techqueria Tech Summit, Oakland Tech Week, and the Latino AI Summit.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4">
      The podcast is an extension of that community work: a space for LatinX practitioners to share what
      they're building and why it matters.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <div class="text-center mt-4 opacity-75">
    <p>New episodes released regularly. Subscribe wherever you listen to podcasts.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
